A tall PNG (default max slot height 30 rows, configurable 1–60 via 
images.max_slot_rows), with a white stripe every 100 px to check scroll
cropping:
































A local SVG (rasterised with resvg, no external refs):




Text after the last image.


Placeholders
────────────────────────────────────────

A remote image is never fetched:

[image: Remote] https://example.com/logo.png — URL images are never fetched

A path that escapes the collection:

[image: Escape] ../../README.md.png — outside the collection

A missing file:

[image: Missing] img/nope.png — file not found

An unsupported format:

[image: Notes] img/notes.txt — unsupported image format


Inline
────────────────────────────────────────

An image inside a sentence [image: inline icon] stays inline text.

• [image: In a list]

│ [image: In a quote]
slot line=13 20x4 small.png
slot line=20 80x10 wide.png
slot line=33 80x10 photo.jpg
slot line=48 16x30 tall.png
slot line=81 10x2 diagram.svg
